<article class="env-lemma" id="0B2F">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0B2F">Lemma <span data-tag="0B2F">33.16.6</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to Y$ be a morphism of schemes over a base scheme $S$. Let $x \in X$ be a point. Set $y = f(x)$. If $\kappa (y) = \kappa (x)$, then $f$ induces a natural linear map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \text{d}f : T_{X/S, x} \longrightarrow T_{Y/S, y}  \]
</div>
  <p> which is dual to the linear map $\Omega _{Y/S, y} \otimes \kappa (y) \to \Omega _{X/S, x} \otimes \kappa (x)$ via the identifications of Lemma <a href="/tag/0B2D" data-tag="0B2D">33.16.4</a>. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
